/SUBR READS IN TEXT PASSAGE IN SUCCESSIV
/TEXT BLOCKS, STARTING WITH BN TBLK
INPUT,	0
	LINC
	LMODE
	STC ONCE	/ONCE THRU FLAG
	LDF 1		/LINC DF=1
